OL,3,GNEWSADiagnostic centre to open by end
OL,4,Aof the year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new community diagnostic centre
OL,7,Fshould open in a city centre by the end
OL,8,Fof this year, NHS bosses hope.
OL,10,FWork to build the facility in central
OL,11,FPeterborough was "advancing well",
OL,12,FNorth West Anglia NHS Foundation
OL,13,FTrust's chief executive Hannah Coffey
OL,14,Fsaid in a report.
OL,16,FShe said she expected the building in
OL,17,FWellington Street to be handed over to
OL,18,Fthe trust in December, with the first
OL,19,Fpatients due to be welcomed by the end
OL,20,Fof the year.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
