OL,3,GNEWSADiagnostic centre to open by end
OL,4,Aof the year
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe centre will house ultrasound and
OL,7,FX-ray facilities, MRI and CT scanners,
OL,8,Fand it is hoped it will help to reduce
OL,9,Fwaiting times for patients.
